    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd, 4th and every three levels thereafter the daevic gains the ability to bind veils directly to his chakra, unlocking potent abilities. He gains the ability to bind to slots in the following order: Feet, Hands, Wrists, Shoulders, Belt, Neck, Chest.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/daevic#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
